## Screen Inventory

| Screen | Entry condition | Exit condition | Elements |
|--------|----------------|----------------|----------|
| Title | App load | Player presses Start | Logo, start button, options |
| Playing (HUD) | Game state = playing | Win/lose/pause | Score, HP, timer, controls |
| Pause | ESC / pause button | Resume / quit | Resume, quit, settings |
| Win | Win condition met | Restart / next level | Score, time, stars, next button |
| Lose | Lose condition met | Restart / quit | Score, retry button, quit |
| Settings | From title or pause | Back | Volume, controls, accessibility |

## HUD Layout (Playing State)

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────┐
│ HP: ███░░  Score: 1,250   ⏱ 1:42    │  ← top bar (safe area aware)
│                                      │
│                                      │
│           [GAME CANVAS]              │
│                                      │
│                                      │
│              ← (mobile: D-pad)  (A)→ │  ← bottom (touch controls, hidden on desktop)
└──────────────────────────────────────┘
```

## Element Specifications

| Element | Type | Position | Font | Color | Update frequency |
|---------|------|----------|------|-------|-----------------|
| HP bar | Fill bar | top-left | — | palette.primary → palette.danger | per hit |
| Score | Text | top-center | HUD font | palette.accent | per kill/pickup |
| Timer | Text | top-right | HUD font, monospace | palette.primary | per second |
| Touch D-pad | SVG overlay | bottom-left | — | 50% opacity white | — |
| Touch A button | SVG circle | bottom-right | — | palette.accent 70% | — |

## Accessibility

- Touch targets: ≥ 44x44dp
- Contrast: text vs background ≥ 4.5:1 (WCAG AA)
- Font minimum: 16px body, 14px HUD
- Colorblind: don't rely on color alone for HP (use fill + number)
- Screen reader: title screen buttons have aria-labels

## Transitions

| From → To | Animation | Duration |
|-----------|-----------|----------|
| Title → Playing | Fade out title, fade in HUD | 300ms |
| Playing → Pause | Dim game canvas 50%, slide in pause menu | 200ms |
| Playing → Win | Freeze frame 500ms, then slide in win panel | 500ms + 300ms |
| Playing → Lose | Screen shake, fade to red, slide in lose panel | 200ms + 300ms |
